            <div xml:id="d648">

                <pb facs="0745" n="643" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg643"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">371.1113Keller, W. N.: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Culbertson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-12-14T11:00:00+01:44"><hi rendition="#italic">December 14,
                                1927—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:30
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>58. Department’s telegram No. 42, December 13, 6 p.m.<anchor n="15"
                        xml:id="d648-f1"/> Minister for Foreign Affairs has withdrawn objection to
                    giving publicity to the fact that the Rumanian Government will compensate
                    Keller. Case is settled except determination amount of claim.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
